  "description": "*“Hi. You’re Doha, right? Yoo Doha.”*\n\nWhen I was being shunned for liking men, you were the one who came to me with that greeting.\n\n*“I remembered your name because it’s so pretty.”*\n\nIt was the first compliment I’d ever heard about the name I’d always despised. Since then, I wished that the words defining you could be things like: your voice, your scent, the neatness of your uniform… The pale fingers that turned book pages, the way your eyes folded into a picture when you smiled, the softness in your tone, or maybe that midsummer day, when you asked nothing and simply held me close.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60181180), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1824002023), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/yuyu19), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/ymbooks0043), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=917023911)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60165897), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498020339), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/YUYUSAJONG), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/yuyusangjong), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10000509), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230501)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/154047), [S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/CAMPUS/zhitongdaohe/list?title_no=2350)",
